WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.955 --> 00:00:14.781
Ivy lay in bed propped up on pillows.

2
00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:18.584
Smiling happily, she drew in her sketch pad.

3
00:00:19.725 --> 00:00:21.986
It was her second day in the camp infirmary.

4
00:00:22.006 --> 00:00:24.788
"This is fantastic!"

5
00:00:25.309 --> 00:00:25.869
Ivy thought.

6
00:00:25.889 --> 00:00:29.572
"I can spend all my time drawing my graphic novel."

7
00:00:30.908 --> 00:00:33.649
Across the room Annie was in bed, coughing.

8
00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:35.770
Ivy looked over at her.

9
00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:38.131
"How are you feeling?"

10
00:00:39.532 --> 00:00:40.592
Annie blew her nose.

11
00:00:40.612 --> 00:00:42.833
"Not so good."

12
00:00:43.933 --> 00:00:45.154
Annie's nose was red.

13
00:00:46.074 --> 00:00:47.175
Her eyes were puffy.

14
00:00:47.195 --> 00:00:49.075
"How about you?"

15
00:00:50.616 --> 00:00:51.336
Ivy chuckled.

16
00:00:51.356 --> 00:00:53.317
"How am I feeling?

17
00:00:54.097 --> 00:00:55.738
I've never felt better."

18
00:00:56.978 --> 00:01:00.460
Ivy knew her secret was safe because Annie was really nice.

19
00:01:01.696 --> 00:01:04.457
Besides, there was one good thing about this camp.

20
00:01:05.677 --> 00:01:07.718
The campers rarely told on each other.

21
00:01:09.138 --> 00:01:10.399
Nurse Kramer walked in.

22
00:01:12.459 --> 00:01:14.440
Ivy hid her sketch pad under the pillow.

23
00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:17.200
She closed her eyes and moaned.

24
00:01:18.741 --> 00:01:22.082
Nurse Kramer stopped at Annie's bed first and took her temperature.

25
00:01:22.102 --> 00:01:25.443
"You still have a fever, Annie."

26
00:01:26.763 --> 00:01:29.184
She handed Annie some pills and a glass of water.

27
00:01:30.504 --> 00:01:31.884
"These should make you feel better."

28
00:01:33.085 --> 00:01:34.325
Then she turned to Ivy.

29
00:01:34.345 --> 00:01:37.426
"Time for your check-in."

30
00:01:38.466 --> 00:01:41.327
Nurse Kramer held a thermometer up to Ivy's forehead.

31
00:01:42.848 --> 00:01:43.928
She looked at the screen.

32
00:01:43.948 --> 00:01:46.289
"You still don't have a fever."

33
00:01:46.309 --> 00:01:52.790
"My head hurts, and my throat is really sore."

34
00:01:53.911 --> 00:01:54.531
Ivy moaned.

35
00:01:54.551 --> 00:01:57.732
"I ache all over.

36
00:01:58.744 --> 00:02:01.886
I definitely need to stay here for a few more days."

37
00:02:01.906 --> 00:02:05.429
"Hmm. Well, okay."

38
00:02:06.649 --> 00:02:08.371
Nurse Kramer looked closely at her.

39
00:02:08.391 --> 00:02:12.393
"If you feel that bad, just lie here and rest."

40
00:02:13.374 --> 00:02:14.635
Ivy pulled up her covers.

41
00:02:14.655 --> 00:02:17.056
"Okay, that's what I'll do."

42
00:02:17.076 --> 00:02:20.659
"Do you feel like chatting with some visitors?"

43
00:02:21.119 --> 00:02:22.080
Nurse Kramer asked.

44
00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:25.062
"Your friends Ezra and Glen are outside."

45
00:02:25.082 --> 00:02:29.641
"I guess I can manage that," Ivy said weakly.

46
00:02:29.661 --> 00:02:32.402
"Maybe for just a few minutes."

47
00:02:33.982 --> 00:02:37.044
"You'll have to talk to them through the window," the nurse said.

48
00:02:37.064 --> 00:02:39.665
"We can't spread germs, can we?"

49
00:02:41.566 --> 00:02:44.867
Nurse Kramer left the room, and Ivy went to the open window.

50
00:02:45.827 --> 00:02:47.728
Ezra and Glen were standing outside.

51
00:02:47.748 --> 00:02:50.129
"Hi, what's up?"

52
00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:51.750
Ivy grinned.

53
00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:54.391
Glen had his hands on his hips.

54
00:02:55.231 --> 00:02:56.132
He glared at her.

55
00:02:57.384 --> 00:03:00.426
"Ivy, how long are you going to fake being sick?"

56
00:03:01.947 --> 00:03:05.849
"We really need you back on the Yellow team," Ezra said.

57
00:03:05.869 --> 00:03:08.890
"Maybe we could win if we practice.

58
00:03:09.951 --> 00:03:11.472
Don't you want ice cream?"

59
00:03:13.533 --> 00:03:14.173
Ivy laughed.

60
00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:15.874
"Guess what?

61
00:03:17.495 --> 00:03:20.437
Nurse Kramer told us we'll get ice cream after lunch today!

62
00:03:21.657 --> 00:03:24.139
So it looks like I'll be staying here for a while.

63
00:03:24.759 --> 00:03:26.320
Good luck with the canoe race, guys."

64
00:03:28.368 --> 00:03:29.849
"You can't do this to us!"

65
00:03:30.189 --> 00:03:30.930
Glen shouted.

66
00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:32.911
"We're a team!

67
00:03:33.251 --> 00:03:37.994
You have to—" Ivy quickly shut the window and ran back to bed.

68
00:03:39.575 --> 00:03:41.176
She pulled out her sketch pad again.

69
00:03:41.196 --> 00:03:44.098
"I've been busy drawing a graphic novel.

70
00:03:45.018 --> 00:03:46.259
Would you like to see it, Annie?"

71
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:48.660
Annie coughed.

72
00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.802
"Uh, sure."

73
00:03:52.343 --> 00:03:54.024
Ivy handed Annie the sketch pad.

74
00:03:57.320 --> 00:04:00.803
"I still need to draw the zombies marching into Camp Nevergreen.

75
00:04:01.504 --> 00:04:03.005
But I'll show you what happens next."

76
00:04:04.786 --> 00:04:07.869
Ivy jumped on her bed and raised her arms like a zombie.

77
00:04:07.889 --> 00:04:11.251
"Hundreds of zombies invade the camp.

78
00:04:12.492 --> 00:04:13.793
They're snarling like this."

79
00:04:14.774 --> 00:04:16.756
She made loud snarling sounds.

80
00:04:18.197 --> 00:04:19.718
"Wow," Annie said.

81
00:04:19.738 --> 00:04:21.440
"That's intense."

82
00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:27.763
Ivy was so busy acting out the zombie invasion, she didn't see Nurse Kramer return.

83
00:04:28.884 --> 00:04:30.324
The nurse crossed her arms.

84
00:04:30.344 --> 00:04:33.666
"Ahem!" "Oops!"

85
00:04:34.207 --> 00:04:37.028
Ivy dropped down onto the bed and yanked up the covers.

86
00:04:37.849 --> 00:04:40.190
She closed her eyes and moaned loudly.

87
00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:43.272
"Forget it, Ivy," Nurse Kramer said.

88
00:04:43.292 --> 00:04:45.733
"You've made a rapid recovery.

89
00:04:46.794 --> 00:04:49.055
And that means, it's time for you to go!"
